### Test Product API Endpoints

# Variables
@baseUrl = https://localhost:7029/api
@productId = 

### Get All Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### Create a Product
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "MacBook Pro",
  "description": "Apple MacBook Pro 16-inch with M3 chip",
  "price": 2499.99,
  "category": "Electronics",
  "inStock": true
}

### Create Another Product  
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "iPhone 15 Pro",
  "description": "Latest iPhone with titanium design",
  "price": 999.99,
  "category": "Electronics", 
  "inStock": true
}

### Get Product by ID (replace with actual ID from create response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}

### Update Product (replace with actual ID)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "MacBook Pro - Updated",
  "description": "Apple MacBook Pro 16-inch with M3 chip - Discounted",
  "price": 2299.99,
  "category": "Electronics",
  "inStock": true
}

### Get Product Count
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/count

### Get Paged Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/paged?page=1&pageSize=5

### Delete Product (replace with actual ID)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}
